<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Prism laser point-defense system -->
  <DNX_PrismLaserPointDefenseSystem.label>棱镜激光点防御系统</DNX_PrismLaserPointDefenseSystem.label>
  <!-- EN: An experimental laser point-defense facility that discharges capacitor energy through a prism emitter to intercept hostile explosive projectiles and disrupt incoming enemy drop pods. <color=yellow>The Prism point-defense system can destroy projectiles and drones, including descending hostile drop pods, with a fairly high success rate and an extremely short cooldown. Each interception consumes energy from capacitor arrays, and high-energy beam limits keep its defensive range very small.</color> -->
  <DNX_PrismLaserPointDefenseSystem.description>一种实验性激光点防御设施，通过棱镜发射器释放电容能量，拦截敌对爆炸射弹，并干扰来袭敌方空投舱。&lt;color=yellow&gt;棱镜点防御装置能够以相当高成功率与极低冷却击毁炮弹与无人机，包括正在降落的敌方空投舱，但是每次拦截都需要消耗电容阵列中的电量，而且受限于高能束技术，能够防御的范围也很小。&lt;/color&gt;</DNX_PrismLaserPointDefenseSystem.description>
  <!-- EN: Toggle automatic laser interception of hostile explosive projectiles. -->
  <DNX_PrismLaserPointDefenseSystem.comps.CompPrismLaserPointDefense.gizmoDescription>切换是否自动用激光拦截敌方爆炸射弹。</DNX_PrismLaserPointDefenseSystem.comps.CompPrismLaserPointDefense.gizmoDescription>
  <!-- EN: Prism point defense: off -->
  <DNX_PrismLaserPointDefenseSystem.comps.CompPrismLaserPointDefense.gizmoLabelOff>棱镜点防御：关闭</DNX_PrismLaserPointDefenseSystem.comps.CompPrismLaserPointDefense.gizmoLabelOff>
  <!-- EN: Prism point defense: on -->
  <DNX_PrismLaserPointDefenseSystem.comps.CompPrismLaserPointDefense.gizmoLabelOn>棱镜点防御：开启</DNX_PrismLaserPointDefenseSystem.comps.CompPrismLaserPointDefense.gizmoLabelOn>
  <!-- EN: Prism point defense -->
  <DNX_PrismLaserPointDefenseSystem.comps.CompPrismLaserPointDefense.inspectLabel>棱镜点防御</DNX_PrismLaserPointDefenseSystem.comps.CompPrismLaserPointDefense.inspectLabel>
  
  <!-- EN: M-33 "Maxwell" dual-mode laser cannon -->
  <DNX_SustainedLaserEmitter.label>M-33“麦克斯韦”双模激光炮</DNX_SustainedLaserEmitter.label>
  <!-- EN: The M-33 "Maxwell" is a large high-power directed-energy weapon that can switch between sustained irradiation and peak discharge modes as battlefield conditions demand. Sustained irradiation steadily burns through energy shields but has limited effect against mechanoids; when switched to peak discharge mode, the turret releases stored energy in a single burst to deliver a high-intensity strike against one target. -->
  <DNX_SustainedLaserEmitter.description>M-33“麦克斯韦”是一座大型高功率定向能武器，可根据战场需求在持续照射与峰值放电两种模式间切换。持续照射模式能够稳定灼穿能量护盾，但对机械族效果有限；切换至峰值放电模式后，炮塔会将积蓄的能量一次性释放，对单个目标实施高强度轰击。</DNX_SustainedLaserEmitter.description>
  
  <!-- EN: laser charge emitter -->
  <DNX_Turret_LaserChargeEmitter.label>激光充能发射器</DNX_Turret_LaserChargeEmitter.label>
  <!-- EN: An experimental laser defense turret that draws a visible charge beam before burning a compact target area. -->
  <DNX_Turret_LaserChargeEmitter.description>一座实验性激光防御炮塔，会先牵引出可见的充能光束，然后灼烧一小片目标区域。</DNX_Turret_LaserChargeEmitter.description>
  
</LanguageData>
